      <div type="layout" source="#source-35143-44533" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p source="#source-35178-41091"><seg source="#source-35178-35208">夏四月甲午朔。天皇幸</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-35208-35220">二</note><seg source="#source-35220-35229">東大寺</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-35229-35241">一</note><seg source="#source-35241-35247">。御</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-35247-35259">二</note><seg source="#source-35259-35280">盧舎那仏像前殿</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-35280-35292">一</note><seg source="#source-35292-35304">、北面対</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-35304-35316">レ</note><seg source="#source-35316-35370">像。皇后太子並侍焉。群臣百寮及士庶分</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-35370-35382">レ</note><seg source="#source-35382-35391">頭行‐</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-35391-35403">二</note><seg source="#source-35403-35412">列殿後</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-35412-35424">一</note><seg source="#source-35424-35427">。</seg><g ref="#gaiji-4-2-3-41" source="#source-35427-35473">勑</g><seg source="#source-35473-35476">遣</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-35476-35488">二</note><seg source="#source-35488-35512">左大臣橘宿禰諸兄</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-35512-35524">一</note><seg source="#source-35524-35527">白</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-35527-35539">レ</note><seg source="#source-35539-35545">仏。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35545-35569"><rb>三宝</rb><rt>サンバウ</rt></ruby><note type="kunten" subtype="okurigana" rend="superscript" source="#source-35569-35587">乃</note><seg source="#source-35587-35590">奴</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="o